    "method": "dsp_host with step tracing (engine/verify_area.py --cycles), the release form: the shell running each of the 22 programs' areas, relocated as code() relocates them, with the stream named by the slot's record and the in-blocks the ColdFire half sends; one instance, 16-sample calls, MIX 127, noise. The last call of runs ending 2 to 33 frames after the program starts (every place a tick can fall in a block), and of runs ending 2 to 17 frames into a fade (PROG moved away), each run bit-exact against the model. Executed instructions a sample (the shell's and the area's; the test's stand-in left out): the dearest, program 53, 307.2 while it plays and 317.4 while it fades; the code is straight-line, so the traced worst path is the static one. Chip cycles by interlock_scan's stall model on the same traces: 341.6 in the dearest block, 353.1 while fading; declared to the base as 355 modeled cycles, which it charges at 7/4 (one instance may take 726). Per program in `programs`. Not measured on a unit."
  },
